(1, 'Mr. Ramesh Barudi', 'As the CEO of Property in Nepal, I am grateful for your choice to work with us as your trusted real estate partner.\nProperty in Nepal has become a top national real estate brokerage, demonstrating strong values and a strong company culture through its long-standing connections.\nOur top priority is our clients seeking real estate options, investment prospects, and the perfect family home, and we welcome sellers and buyers to experience professionalism.\n', 'https://www.facebook.com/BarudiRamesh', 'https://np.linkedin.com/in/ramesh-barudi-397b35150', '2023-09-24 08:40:43', '2025-06-04 17:10:11');
